            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.10.9+REV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 10:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were owaco ran ni, “Wod dhano, gima omiyin, cami, cami papila m'omin, aka kadhi iluwi gi ot pa Isiraili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno ayawo dhokan, to go miyan acamo papila m'omin no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owaco ran ni, “Wod dhano, cami papila m'omin m'amiyin, aka poŋ koko i iyin gine.” Kenyo acamo; aka obedo mamit i dhokan paka mo kic.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owaco ran ni, “Wod dhano, kadhi i ot pa Isiraili, aka iluwi wac paran rijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole akiorin bongi ji ma joluwo dhodhok ma kiniaŋere kosa ma ikiniaŋ wac pajo, to bongi ot pa Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akiorin bongi nonin kweth, ma joluwo dhodhok ma kiniaŋere kodi ma lew jo pek ma ikinyal niaŋ wac pajo. Adieri, ka bedi oyido aorin bongi jo, dinyo jowinjin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ot pa Isiraili jokilawinjin, kole jokwero winjan; kwoŋbedo jobedo jowictek aka jonitie gi cuny matek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, ee amiyo waŋin bedo matek paka waŋ jo, kodi bedo gi wictek paka jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka tele matek loyo, tele mabith, atieko timo nyimin, aka Ikir'ilwor jo kosa idhier ro neno pajo; kole jobedo ot ma jogwenyirok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owaco ran ni, “Wod dhano, Wac paran je m'aluwo rin jol i cunyin aka winji gi ithin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadhi bongi jotwec, bongi ji perin iluwi gi jo. Waci rijo ni, ‘Rwoth Were waco ama.’ Makada nende jowinji kosa jokwer.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekiel i malawa Kebar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo cuny otiŋan malo, aka awinjo derino ma mor yuŋeyan ka waco ama: Dwoŋ pa Rwoth wopak i kabedo me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awinjo derino ma bwombi cwec makwo ka jogeyere bwombi gin kwoŋ bwombi man, kodi derino ma lipangala i thengi jo, derino ma mor madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuny otiŋan malo, to kwanyan woko. Awinjo keco i cunyan, aka cingi Rwoth obedo matek kwoŋan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abino bongi jotwec i Telabib, m'oyido jobedo i thengi malawa Kebar, aka adoŋ kenyo i dhier i dier jo ma ndelo abirio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rwoth ketho Ezekiel paka jakur i Isiraili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I cowe ma ndelo abirio, wac pa Rwoth obino ran, ka waco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod dhano, akethin bedo jakur i ot pa Isiraili, ilawinjo wac ma wok i dhokan, aka ilagwoko jo kwoŋan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'awaco ri jokidakana ni, “Ilatho adieri.” T'iweyo m'ikigwoko jo, kosa iluwo gi jo weyo tim ma kidakana pajo, jokidakana no jolatho ro reco pajo, to remo pajo ladoŋ i cingin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'igwoko jokidakana, to jokwero wire kwoŋ kidakana pajo, kosa tim ma kidakana, jolatho, to ri in, labedo nike ibotho kwo perin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ŋata timo gim'otire owire to timo gima k'otire, aka anoriwere ruwaŋe, jolatho, kwoŋbedo ikigwoko jo, jolatho ro reco pajo, kilapoyo tim pajo m'otire je; to remo pajo ladoŋ i cingin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'igwoko ŋata timo gim'otire weyo ma k'otimo reco, aka jowey ma jok'otimo reco, jolakwo adieri, aka ri in, labedo nike ibotho kwo perin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iketho Ezekiel kakende aka liŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cingi Rwoth oyido nitie kwoŋan kenyo, aka go owaco ran ni, “Ay malo, ikadhi i milelo, aka alaluwo kodin kenyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno aay malo, aka akidho i milelo. Dwoŋ pa Rwoth ocungo kenyo, paka dwoŋ m'oyido atieko neno i thengi malawa Kebar; aka agore piny gi nyiman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuny odonjo i an, omiyan cungo gi tiendan; aka go oluwo kodan to waco ran ni, “Kadhi icegere i ot perin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka ri in, wod dhano, ilaketho kwoŋin adasin, t'itweyin gine, ŋey ikir'iwok woko i dier jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
